{"cache_key":"3f923ea1bca1873a8649553c82dcdec8505775f3a8c52275b5432e3898286850","segment_id":"adminConfirm","source_path":"extensions/openclaw-id-access/browser/i18n/locales/en.ts","src_lang":"en","text":"The {role} role has administrator access. Administrators can change Gateway settings, manage devices and approvals, and access connected services. Only invite someone you trust with this claw.","text_hash":"501a577307b56c02c57b6fb3404de13413347715afff76eb67510e60bb222d4c","tgt_lang":"nl","translated":"De rol {role} heeft beheerderstoegang. Beheerders kunnen Gateway-instellingen wijzigen, apparaten en goedkeuringen beheren en toegang krijgen tot verbonden diensten. Nodig alleen iemand uit aan wie je deze claw toevertrouwt.","updated_at":"2026-11-16T09:22:33.095Z"}
